# AI-SDLC guardrails
- Read intent.md and spec.md before changing code.
- Implement only what spec.md allows. Do not invent endpoints.
- Update spec.md before adding a new endpoint.
- Write or update failing tests first, then make them pass.
- Stop when `dotnet test` is green. Do not refactor beyond the current spec.
